WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.134 --> 00:00:29.930
Kip was still thinking about the circus.

2
00:00:29.931 --> 00:00:33.619
Suddenly he heard something: Yip! Yip!

3
00:00:33.620 --> 00:00:45.026
A puppy was loose!

4
00:00:45.027 --> 00:00:49.698
The puppy was running right toward Kip.

5
00:00:49.699 --> 00:00:52.218
"Yip! Yip!" barked the puppy.

6
00:00:52.219 --> 00:00:54.650
"Ahh!" cried Kip.

7
00:00:54.651 --> 00:01:02.342
Kip jumped into a bush.

8
00:01:02.343 --> 00:01:05.809
The puppy got hold of a branch.

9
00:01:05.810 --> 00:01:08.546
Then the puppy let go.

10
00:01:08.547 --> 00:01:13.899
Kip flew through the air like an acrobat!

11
00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:18.825
Kip landed in a tree.

12
00:01:18.826 --> 00:01:32.597
He walked like a tightrope walker!

13
00:01:32.598 --> 00:01:39.482
Then the branch snapped!

14
00:01:39.483 --> 00:01:45.575
Kip fell down to the ground.

15
00:01:45.576 --> 00:01:49.643
The puppy wagged its tail.

16
00:01:49.644 --> 00:01:52.166
"Yip! Yip!" It barked.

17
00:01:52.167 --> 00:01:55.999
The puppy just wanted to play!

18
00:01:56.000 --> 00:02:08.989
Kip had an idea . . .

19
00:02:08.990 --> 00:02:11.539
"Sit down," said Kip.

20
00:02:11.540 --> 00:02:14.263
The puppy sat down!

21
00:02:14.264 --> 00:02:17.087
"Roll over," said Kip.

22
00:02:17.088 --> 00:02:20.070
The puppy rolled over!

23
00:02:20.071 --> 00:02:23.233
"Wow!" said Kip.

24
00:02:23.234 --> 00:02:25.821
"I'm a puppy tamer!"

25
00:02:25.822 --> 00:02:29.585
"You put on a great show!" said Bird.

26
00:02:29.586 --> 00:02:35.299
"Just like the circus!" said Kip.
